    "description": "An esm 1.2.0 document that imports tests/fixtures/version_gate/library_v110_const_units.esm, an esm 1.1.0 template library whose template body carries a unit-bearing `const`. Each file is held to its OWN declared version (esm-spec §4.7), a template library included: the importing document being new enough does not make the library legal, so this MUST be rejected with `const_units_version_too_old`.",
